SUMMARY:LGBTQ+ Culture Center- OPEN HOUSE
DESCRIPTION:The LGBTQ+ Culture Center welcomes you to IU Bloomington! Joi
 n us for our annual open house.      Join us at our open house as we shar
 e more about our Fall 2026 programs and services\, build community with o
 ther new and returning students\, and enjoy a warm Hoosier welcome to IU.
       All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, educational\,
  cultural\, and historical observances welcome all members of the Indiana
  University community.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div class="lw_cal_event_detail_block" id="l
 w_cal_event_detail_intro"><p>    The LGBTQ+ Culture Center welcomes you t
 o IU Bloomington! Join us for our annual open house.  </p></div><div clas
 s="lw_cal_event_detail_block" id="lw_cal_event_detail_description"><p>   
  Join us at our open house as we share more about our Fall 2026 programs 
 and services\, build community with other new and returning students\, an
 d enjoy a warm Hoosier welcome to IU.  </p><p>    All Indiana University 
 events\, groups\, activities\, educational\, cultural\, and historical ob
 servances welcome all members of the Indiana University community.  </p><
 /div>
