X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2335749
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>Join us for an evening of food\, friendship\, and 
 community at the IU LGBTQ+ Culture Center's Friendsgiving celebration! Wh
 ether you're far from home\, looking to make new connections\, or simply 
 want to share a meal with chosen family\, all are welcome. Come enjoy gre
 at food\, meaningful conversation\, and a space to celebrate gratitude to
 gether.</p>
END:VEVENT
