X-SOURCE:IU LGBTQ+ Culture Center
DTSTART:20261202T223000Z
DTEND:20261203T000000Z
LOCATION:750 E. Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington\, IN 40705
SUMMARY:World AIDS Day
UID:20261202T223000Z-2341890@events.iu.edu
